OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine and
OL,6,Fdry evening with sunny spells.
OL,7,FRemaining dry for much of the night
OL,8,Fbut cloud thickening overnight, with
OL,9,Fsome patchy light rain possible by
OL,10,Fdawn. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA wet start with outbreaks
OL,13,Fof rain, light at first but heavier
OL,14,Fbursts developing. Perhaps some brief
OL,15,Fdrier spells into the evening but
OL,16,Fremaining mostly cloudy. Breezy,
OL,17,Fespecially on coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
