OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FMostly dry and partly cloudy for the
OL,7,Fnext few days, although some showers
OL,8,Fare possible, perhaps occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy. Feeling warm in the sun and
OL,10,Fmild overnight. Occasionally breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
